            <ArticleTitle>[Spontaneous peri-renal haematoma as a complication of chronic pyelonephritis].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>112-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Three cases with spontaneous peri-renal haematomas, a rare complication of chronic pyelonephritis, are described. The clinical features and diagnosis of this condition are discussed with reference to these cases and the literature is reviewed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
